{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgENGcJnGw9GkyXRRqcNW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both symptoms reproduce. `hide()` raises the loud `ValidationException` from the prod log. The feed returns a story whose `hidden` flag is set, because `hidden` is dropped silently from the ProjectionExpression. Dasha's CLI write itself was correct; the read side is what fails.\n\nI also spotted a third instance of the same class: `archive()` puts `status` bare in a ConditionExpression, and `status` is reserved. I'll read the files before editing."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4459,"cache_read_input_tokens":31114,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4459},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fd166e8f-00a3-447a-bf2a-ff8085424637","uuid":"0ab8a3d5-b2b0-4ad1-bd8e-bd152d74a41f","timestamp":"2026-10-20T23:36:41.564Z","request_id":"req_011CgENGc2vNjdpaoyUSdGUq"}
